{"676270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Mofflys: Invasion Mayhem", "steam_appid": 676270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676270/extras/0517572a4f8d6fbd15894032d6299a03.avif?t=1741623981\" width=616 height=75 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676270/extras/2d2c32373273f73b22fcf48ead85d0a1.poster.avif?t=1741623981\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676270/extras/2d2c32373273f73b22fcf48ead85d0a1.webm?t=1741623981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676270/extras/2d2c32373273f73b22fcf48ead85d0a1.mp4?t=1741623981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>&quot;The Mofflys,&quot; a VR party game, combines alien shenanigans, hilarious jokes, and lively mini-games across four worlds. Launch your invasion of Earth to spread mayhem and laughter as the most amusing murder clone in the galaxy. Ideal for players seeking a fun-filled space adventure, &quot;The Mofflys&quot; delivers endless laughter through masterful VR and comedic moments, ensuring every invasion is enjoyably unforgettable.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676270/extras/a933210efd110a279da4f1f62b414b07.avif?t=1741623981\" width=616 height=75 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676270/extras/6aa9a3987a637e1118e60902c1e79f6a.poster.avif?t=1741623981\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676270/extras/6aa9a3987a637e1118e60902c1e79f6a.webm?t=1741623981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676270/extras/6aa9a3987a637e1118e60902c1e79f6a.mp4?t=1741623981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Navigate four distinct environments: the Wild West, Undersea, Outer Space, and Ancient Egypt, each offering unique challenges and hilarity. Claim your comedic dominion over Earth as you explore these diverse settings, making every conquest as humorous as it is triumphant. Ready for adventure, you'll find laughter and surprises at every turn.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676270/extras/f1fe3c4bfe8710fa90d93b8c2a9c2534.avif?t=1741623981\" width=616 height=75 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676270/extras/c00df2dba40ceea44e11a35d898ddb9a.poster.avif?t=1741623981\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676270/extras/c00df2dba40ceea44e11a35d898ddb9a.webm?t=1741623981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676270/extras/c00df2dba40ceea44e11a35d898ddb9a.mp4?t=1741623981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Tackle 10 mini-games that challenge your agility and wit. From capturing critters in the Wild West to battling ancient Egyptian skulls, each game is packed with fun and laughs. Designed for excitement and amusement, these games ensure your journey through &quot;The Mofflys&quot; is filled with laughter and lively moments.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/676270/extras/2f13b6f4c5b8469554fdf3